item.description:
Poll after poll continues to show strong enthusiasm for Democrats, including for Senate candidates in deep red states. But are they setting expectations of a blue wave too high? We look at recent history for a reality check.&nbsp;

---&nbsp;

Guest: Zachary B. Wolf, CNN Politics Senior Writer&nbsp;

Host: David Rind&nbsp;

Producer: Paola Ortiz&nbsp;

Showrunner: Felicia Patinkin
Learn more about your ad choices. Visit podcastchoices.com/adchoices

